{"text": "SAGEBRUSH FAMILY MEDICINE                                        OFFICE VISIT\nPatient: BEGAYE, LORETTA M.      MRN: SFM-0088213      DOB: 11/08/1967 (58 y/o F)\nDOS: 02/12/2026    Provider: Dr. Okwuosa    Visit type: established, 30 min\nInsurance: Four Corners Health Alliance, ID FCH-771-204-881\n\nS:  Mrs. Begaye returns for follow-up of type 2 diabetes, on insulin pump since 2022\n    (pump serial NG2308841PX). Says she has been \"forgetting\" meal boluses most days since\n    her husband Leonard died in October. Sleeping 4-5 hrs. Appetite poor, then snacks late.\n    Admits to 3-4 beers most nights, up from \"almost never.\" Denies thoughts of\n    self-harm. PHQ-9 today: 14. No chest pain, no vision change, feet OK.\n    She is Diné and drives in from Shiprock, about 40 minutes each way; missed\n    the December visit because of the roads. Reminded me again that she is one of Jehovah's Witnesses\n    and will not accept blood products; advance directive is on file.\n\nO:  BP 148/92, HR 84, Wt 187 lb, BMI 32.1. Alert, tearful when discussing husband.\n    HEENT unremarkable. Lungs clear. Feet: monofilament intact bilaterally.\n    Labs 2/5/2026: A1c 8.9% (was 7.6% in August), eGFR 61, LDL 118,\n    urine microalbumin mildly elevated. CGM download: time in range 41%.\n\nA:  1. Type 2 diabetes, uncontrolled, with missed boluses (ICD-10 code in chart)\n    2. Moderate depression, likely bereavement-related\n    3. Hypertension, above goal\n    4. Risky alcohol use, new\n\nP:  - Pump: bolus reminders turned on at 7, 12 and 6. Continue metformin 1000 mg BID.\n    - Increase lisinopril to 40 mg daily. Recheck BP in 4 wks per ADA guidelines.\n    - Start sertraline 50 mg daily. Rx 6620417 sent to Chaco Trail Pharmacy, 505-555-0127.\n    - Brief alcohol counseling done. She agrees to cut back; declines medication for it.\n    - Referral to Yvonne Tsosie, LCSW, at Red Mesa Behavioral Health for grief counseling.\n      Loretta prefers a counselor who speaks Navajo; Ms. Tsosie does.\n    - OK to call her at (505) 555-0191; do not leave details with her son.\n    - RTC 3/12/2026.\n\nElectronically signed: Chidi Okwuosa, MD   NPI 1730284416   02/12/2026 17:41", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "325 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["LORETTA M. BEGAYE", "LEONARD"], "companies": ["Four Corners Health Alliance", "Chaco Trail Pharmacy", "Red Mesa Behavioral Health"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Shiprock"], "health": ["Type 2 diabetes", "Moderate depression", "Hypertension", "Risky alcohol use", "Metformin", "insulin pump", "A1c 8.9%", "eGFR 61", "LDL 118", "urine microalbumin mildly elevated", "PHQ-9", "alcohol use"], "sensitive": ["Diné", " Jehovah's Witnesses", " bereavement"], "names": ["Loretta"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 21242.699999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 72, "end": 77, "text": "VISIT", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Okwuosa Visit"}, {"start": 87, "end": 105, "text": "BEGAYE, LORETTA M.", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "LORETTA M. BEGAYE"}, {"start": 116, "end": 127, "text": "SFM-0088213", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "SFM-0088213"}, {"start": 138, "end": 148, "text": "11/08/1967", "kind": "dob", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "11/08/1967"}, {"start": 165, "end": 175, "text": "02/12/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "02/12/2026"}, {"start": 193, "end": 209, "text": "Okwuosa    Visit", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Okwuosa Visit"}, {"start": 247, "end": 275, "text": "Four Corners Health Alliance", "kind": "company", "sourc